# emoji-gta.pdl - backtick (emoji) mode for gta-hq (2026-10-12, claude): which Unicode emoji stands for which GTA role, and whether the engine already has its 3D voxel model.
# EMOJI | role | codepoint | glyph | unicode name | voxels | note     voxels = have (&.widgits/board-viewer/pieces/registry/emoji_assets/<codepoint>/voxels_16.csv exists) or missing (2D can use a font; 3D needs a model made).
# Names from #.NNEST_ASSETS/unicode-emoji/emoji-test-17.0.txt. 2D emoji glyph drawing in gta-hq and the backtick binding are NOT built (today backtick = a 2D Chinese/ASCII view, piececraft-hq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl key 96).
